WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:01.950
Astral...

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.770
Eliphas told me...

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.950
...that he entrusted the future to us.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.640
That's why I mustn't cry.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.400
We now carry the hopes of countless friends...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.130
Yuma! Shark!

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.620
We absolutely have to win this Duel!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.920
Just because you broke my Numeron Network and replenished some of your Life Points,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.730
you're sure, you can win?

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.110
My turn, draw!

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:37.220
At this moment, the banished "Chaos Number 1,

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.080
Gate of Chaos Numeron Shunya" is revived!

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.040
But "Numeron Network" is no longer on the field!

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:52.000
Your Numeron Shunya is destroyed.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.600
With this, we wont get hit by the 50.000 damage from Shunya's effect!

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.640
You fool. This is a <i>Duel of Gods</i>.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:06.400
However that may be, for you there will be only dispair.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:11.170
I activate the Spell Card "Numeron Chaos Ritual"!

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:15.570
It activates, when "Numeron Shunya" is destroyed,

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:20.240
It allows me to target a "Numeron Network" and 4 Numbers in my Graveyard,

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:24.170
and treat them as Level 12 Monsters,

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:26.060
and then Xyz Summon using them.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:31.310
I take my Level 12 Numbers 1 to 4

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.930
and Numeron Network to overlay them!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.800
Xyz Summon!

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.640
Come forth, Chaos Number 1000!

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.640
The Fears of Chaos is the Doom of the pathetic Mankind!

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:54.460
Your Dreams of Heaven and Earth are a never ending Chimeara!

00:01:55.350 --> 00:02:00.170
Oh Empty God who owns the Darkness, smash with it the Light!

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:04.420
Numerronius the Hollow Titan of Fantasy!

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:06.410
{marker}

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:10.590
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:15.830
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:27.520
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.700
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:38.520
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.500
the feelings I want to express.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:51.520
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.770
Right now, with you

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:58.700
Oh - By facing each other,

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:05.780
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:10.880
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:16.310
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:21.480
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:31.060
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.610
Tha- that's Chaos Number - 1000?!

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:45.120
<i>"Our Feelings are as One!
The Dragon of Creation, Numeron Dragon"</i>

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:44.070
No way... It's got 10.000 ATK?!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.030
<i>You</i> can only...

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.000
...submit in front of such a force.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.580
Now, Numerronius, attack "Dark Knight".

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.710
It's 10.000 ATK will let you disappear without a trace!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.300
Tha- that's...!

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:00.590
Yuma!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:05.390
As if I let you! Trap activate, "Advantage Location"!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.850
When a Water-Monster battles,

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:11.810
the ATK of the opposing monster is halved until the end of the battle

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.400
and my monster is protected from destruction!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.070
You don't know when to give in, no?

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.900
But you still take the damage!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:34.540
And the Astral World will receive that damage too!

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.710
It will be alright. Everything will be alright.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.800
Yuma and his friends are fighting.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.220
For the sake of our... no, everyone's future.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.310
So let's believe.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.730
You survived that?

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.230
But now, I'll show you Numerronius' true power.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.190
I activate Numerronius' effect.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:06.570
During either player's turn, when the battle ends, all of my opponents' monsters are destroyed.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.780
What?!

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.490
Dark Knight!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.250
And, all the monsters that were sent to the Graveyard this turn

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:21.710
are Special Summoned to my side of the field in face-up Defense Position.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.630
And with <i>that</i>, I end my turn.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.720
What an effect... At this rate...

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:32.180
Not yet! We haven't... lost yet!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.890
Everyone has entrusted their feelings to us

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.900
and their future rests in our hearts!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.110
Let's do it, Astral!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:41.770
Sure!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.780
I take myself...

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.780
...And me,

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.200
and we overlay!

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.870
The Strongest Bonds lead to the Light!

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.040
Xyz Change!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.550
ZeXal!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.180
This is the first form of ZeXal that Yuma and Astral combined into!

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:13.470
Don Thousand! We're going to crush you using everything we've got!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.850
So you appeared, ZeXal.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:18.690
But how would to you beat me?

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.520
Sure we win! Totally!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.030
My turn! All the light and all the power...

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:28.650
gather in my right arm and shine on the way to Hope!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.200
Shining Draw!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.910
I activate the Spell Card "Re-Xyz"!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.960
I choose an Xyz Monster in my Graveyard,

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.670
and also choose the monsters required for the Special Summon from my graveyard!

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:49.880
From my graveyard, I overlay the Level 4 "Gagaga Magician" and "Toy Knight"!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.260
Xyz Summon!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:57.980
Appear, Number 39: Hope the King of Wishes!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:05.480
Useless struggle! I activate the other effect of Numerronius!

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.860
By using one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.240
it destroys an opponent's monster.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.410
Hope!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:18.660
Then I chose one Chaos Number from the opponent's Extra Deck,

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.120
and special summon it, ignoring it's summon conditions!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:27.090
Show yourself, Hope Ray Victory, the King of Wishes!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:33.890
Wh... what, why would destroy Hope but then bring Victory to our field?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.100
As long as Numerronius is on the field,

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.230
the effect of the opponent's Chaos Numbers are negated...

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.230
...and also, it can't attack.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:50.150
In front of me, the Chaos Numbers you bastards possess are helpless!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.030
That's... Then, Yuma and the guys will...?

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.490
It's not over yet!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.160
We're not giving up!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:03.500
I said, we'll use <i>all </i>of our power to defeat you!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:09.800
Burning Passion leads the way to victory!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.470
Xyz Second Change!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.840
ZeXal!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.890
That's the second form of ZeXal!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.060
I activate the Spell Card "Xyz Treasure"!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:28.730
This card lets me draw 1 card for each Xyz Monster on the field.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.860
So I draw 3 cards!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.660
In the Duel of the Strongest Duelist, everything is inevitable!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:40.910
Even the cards to draw are created by the Duelist!
Triple Shining Draw!

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.500
It came, Don Thousand!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:48.590
I Normal Summon "ZEXAL Servers - Ouroboros Sage"!

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:52.010
When this monster is successfully Summoned,

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:58.430
I can Special Summon 1 non-LIGHT monster from my Graveyard!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:07.150
Show yourself, Number 101: Silent Honors Ark Knight!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.940
And now, I activate Ouroboros Sage's other effect! {marker}

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.650
Ouroboros Sage and a Monster with Hope in its name...

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:20.160
equip Ark Knight, who was special summoned by this effect,

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.450
and ad both their ATK to his!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.870
Let's go!

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.960
I'll have Ark Knight attack Numerronius!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.790
But why!?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.380
Ark Knight has less Attack!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.970
At this moment, Ouroboros Knight's next effect activates!

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:40.430
The ATK of the Monster equipped with this card...

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.560
... is doubled!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.060
11000 Attack!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:51.150
This is our power! Go!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:03.410
Smash Numerronius to pieces!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.830
Hope Sword Ark Knight Slash

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:19.890
Yeah!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.760
You did it~!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.350
With this, Numerronius is scrapped...

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:25.560
No...

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:31.060
What!? Numerronius wasn't destroyed!?

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:34.860
And Dark Knight isn't on his side of the field anymore...

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:39.990
The moment your attack struck me, I activated Numerronius' effect.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.870
By sending a monster of mine to the Graveyard,

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:46.040
I can prevent Numerronius from being destroyed.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.040
It has such  an effect too!?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.710
And now I activate Numeronius' effect!

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:57.090
When battle ends, all of my opponent's monsters are destroyed!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.850
And now all monsters that were sent to the Graveyard this turn,

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:12.610
are special summoned to my field in face-up Defense Position!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.400
Even with ZeXal's power...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.360
That bastard, just how can we...!?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:24.120
Tsukumo Yuma, you never can stand against the power of Chaos.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:28.080
That's because Humans are the root of all Chaos.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.160
We are!?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:35.750
Correct, and that power of Chaos will always bring me back to life.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.510
So that's why you tampered with the memories of the Seven Barian Emperors?

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:44.800
Astral, I'll admit I lost our <i>fight</i> eons ago.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:50.810
But, your power too became 50 of the Numbers, due to the shock from that battle.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:56.110
And with the location of the Numeron Code incised in these cards,

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:59.110
they were scattered on the human world.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:05.030
And then the 7 Numbers that sealed my power

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:09.950
and the sages deposited them with the chosen heroes on Earth.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.830
Those are the Numbers from the Ruins!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:16.590
That's how you placed a curse on the ones with those Numbers!

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.500
That's absolutely correct.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:22.630
To those, who were to become the fuel to my resurrection,

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:25.090
I gave the power of Chaos.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.060
You human maggots are weak.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:32.060
And because of that weakness, you easily get consumed by Chaos,

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:37.110
like the friend you trusted most, Durbe.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:45.530
And the important person in your life, Merag, is no exception.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.370
You damn...

00:12:55.580 --> 00:13:00.460
Nasch, even you are guided by my curse.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:04.050
Why you were reborn as a Barian...?

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.800
...You soon will know.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.260
What did you say!?

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:09.850
Don Thousand!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.230
Humans might be weak.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:17.060
But don't assume I'll use Chaos how you think I will!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:21.400
We use the power of Chaos to protect others!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.950
It's the power that lets you live with your friends!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.910
So we absolutely, totally ain't gonna lose!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:31.580
I set 4 cards and end my turn!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.040
So you still cling to that faint hope?

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.580
My turn, draw!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.710
I activate the Spell Card Numeron Stone!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.960
If I control a "Numerronius" monster,

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.930
I can destroy all of my opponent's Spells and Traps!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:53.060
With this, you've lost everything.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:58.770
Furthermore, this card's effect inflicts 1000 damage to my opponent!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:09.030
Oh no... and their Life Points are 100...

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.330
You have no monster on your field.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.040
And there are no cards left in your hand or on the field.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.250
This is the time of your destruction.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.500
Numerronius, attack them directly!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.510
This is the time of your destruction.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:32.470
Numerronius, attack them directly!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.520
Yuma!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.810
I'm sorry, everyone!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.310
Yuma.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.570
You're giving up, just like that?

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.570
No way... You're...!?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.830
No... no way...

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.580
What's with your usual "<i>Bring it to 'em</i>"?

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.620
You slowpoke.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.330
Kaito!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.630
I've entrusted everything to you guys.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.050
Beat him, Yuma.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.220
Kaito...

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.640
This is...

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:18.480
The effect of the Numeron Dragon I got from Kaito...

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.060
Is Kaito with us...?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.900
Kaito...

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.280
Let's do it!

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.360
Astral! Shark!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:36.030
I activate the effect of "Number 100: Numeron Dragon"!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:39.710
This card, if I have no cards in my hand or on my field,

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.580
and I'm about to be hit by my opponent's direct attack,

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:46.040
I can Special Summon this card from my Extra Deck, in Defense Position!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:50.760
The Key to the Creation of the Universe, now open the Door of Darkness,

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.010
lead us to the future with your roar!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.510
Descend, Number 100!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.100
Numeron Dragon!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.560
This is absurd...

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:08.940
You bastards managed to awaken the Numeron Dragon!?

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:12.400
No matter, I'll still blow it away!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.530
Attack Numeron Dragon!

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:18.410
I activate Numeron Dragon's new effect!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:22.460
Monsters that battle this card have their ATK become Zero!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.130
Such an effect...

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:32.840
But, due to Numerronius' effect, after a battle ends, all of my opponent's monsters are destroyed!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.800
Now, Yuma!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:37.800
Got it!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.850
I activate Numeron Dragon's other other effect!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:46.400
When this card is destroyed, all of my opponent's monsters are destroyed!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.570
And with this, you ain't got jack on the field!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:01.200
And now I activate yet another effect of Numeron Dragon!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:06.670
All the Spells and Traps that were destroyed this turn are revived!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:11.800
Our Ray of Hope hasn't vanished yet, Don Thousand!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.380
How foolish... It seems you still don't get it.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:19.390
You have merely opening the door of despair every time you try.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.850
When my Numerronius is destroyed,

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:27.560
I can make it an Xyz Material from the Graveyard and Overlay it!

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.530
Extermination!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.450
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:42.660
Descend, Chaos Imaginary Number 1000!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.370
My heaven is vast, my earth is ancient.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.630
The dreams that men cling to are a mere illusion.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:56.510
O God of Void, Owner of the Darkness, hammer down upon the Light!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:01.850
Numerronius Numerronia the Brilliant Hollow Titan of Fantasy!

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:04.850
A Rank 13 Chaos Number!?

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.100
It has 100,000 Attack!?

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:12.020
This card cannot attack you.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.740
But, while this card is on the field,

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.280
my opponent's monsters <i>must</i> attack it, no matter what.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:21.910
And when a turn ends in which you don't attack,

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.990
you have lost.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:28.540
A 100,000 Attack monstrosity that we <i>have</i> to attack...

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.000
That...  there's no way we can possibly win!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:35.170
You <i>get it</i>?

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.630
The hope left in you bastards...

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.430
... nothing is left of it at all!

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:43.810
I won't give up.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.230
I absolutely won't give up.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.190
Not until the very very end!

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:56.820
For the sake of our friends who are gone and entrusted their feelings to us...

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:00.070
I totally refuse to give up!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.070
Let's go, Shark! Astral!

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.410
Without saying, Yuma!

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.040
We'll do this together, Yuma!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:08.540
I and...!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:09.710
Me...!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.630
... Overlay!

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.300
Brightest Ray of Hope, guide us to the future!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.550
Ultimate Xyz Change!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.510
ZeXal!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.060
The third form of ZeXal!?

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:28.810
I activate the Trap Card "Session Draw"!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.100
When we draw for next turn,

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:34.190
we will draw one card additionally to my normal draw!

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:39.360
At that time, if both drawn cards are monsters of the same Level,

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.990
those two cards can be used for an Xyz Summon.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.080
Still clinging to that tiny bit of hope?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.200
I end my turn.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.870
Let's do it, Yuma, Astral!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.920
Yeah, this is our Destiny Draw!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:57.710
Barian's Chaos Draw!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.760
Destiny Shining Draw!

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:05.890
It came!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:10.350
I've drawn "ZeXal Weapon - Tornado Bringer"!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.400
The card I've drawn is "Panther Shark"!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.070
Their Levels are 5!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:20.360
We overlay these two cards!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.360
Xyz Summon.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:28.200
Come forth, Number 73.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.290
Abyss Splash the Raging Waterfall Deity!

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:35.960
And I activate the Trap Card "Rising Hope"!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.130
"Hope the King of Wishes" from my Graveyard...

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:43.680
... is special summoned and equipped it with this card!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.680
And now I activate another Trap Card! "Bonds of Hope"!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:53.730
When an Xyz Monster is Special Summoned to my side of the field,

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:57.810
a new Xyz Monster is Special Summoned from the Graveyard!

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.860
Show yourself, Number 100.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.570
Numeron Dragon!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:11.200
Then, Bonds of Hope and all Xyz Monsters with their the Overlay Units on our field

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:15.830
are attached as Overlay Units to an Xyz Monster we control!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.750
I chose Hope!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.840
Now Hope has 3 Xyz Material.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:26.340
Yuma, I entrust our hopes to you.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:27.760
Shark....

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:33.100
I activate the other effect of the "Rising Hope" equipped to Hope!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:38.520
Hope can use the Xyz Material using effects of Numeron Dragon and Abyss Splash!

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.230
What!?

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:45.200
The effects of all your other monsters are combined in Hope!?

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:50.160
Those three monsters are...

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.700
Yuma... Shark... Kaito...

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.330
It's everyone's power as one...

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:58.210
Don Thousand!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.420
Our feelings... our hopes...

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:07.430
This time you're gonna get hit with them!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:10.260
{marker}

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.890
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:16.310
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.600
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.270
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:24.860
Let it go.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:38.160
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.380
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:49.300
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.640
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.440
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.360
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:07.530
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:11.910
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.790
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.540
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:22.000
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.130
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.960
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.380
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.890
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:43.810
Everyone's feelings become one and gather within Hope.

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:48.360
Can we cut through the sword Don Thousand drew, and proceed towards the future?

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:49.860
The end draws near!

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:53.700
It seems like you have underestimated the power of bonds.

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:56.200
Let's finish this age-old battle!

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:58.330
Just beat that Don Thousand guy up!

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:01.580
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZeXaL II!

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:05.460
"End of Chaos - The Deadly Final Hope Sword Slash!!"

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.840
This is our final Hope!
